sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Business strategist
    participant F as Financial strategist
    participant M as Marketing specialist
    participant G as Governance owner
    B->>B: Capture strategy brief
    B->>F: Handoff business plan and assumptions
    F->>B: Return financial model and gaps
    B->>M: Handoff business plan and finance constraints
    M->>B: Return go-to-market plan
    B->>G: Submit integrated review
    G-->>B: Approve or block with required corrections
    B->>B: Publish handoff or correction plan
